{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261027/photo/bkn-20261027223917374-1027_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261027232322\"/><p>案發瀑布灣石灘。</p><p>今午(27日)3時18分，香港仔瀑布灣道一石灘，有途人報案指一名姓梁(80歲)老翁，在上址岸邊漂浮。救援人員接報到場，立刻把梁翁撈起，經檢查證實他已經死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。案件列作「屍體發現」處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:00:48.407331+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T14:39:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T15:58:21.636766+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:58:21.636766+00:00","content_hash":"9b5b094fb909451fb58a34bcc33f612fdf3ab643547f093427d425471eb65bd3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}